  "body": "Right now, [document write steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#document-write-steps) have roughly the same checks and bailouts as [document open steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#document-open-steps). A notable exception is the same-origin check in document open steps that is not in document write steps. Maybe we could add that check to the document write steps as well?\r\n\r\nChrome already [implements](https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/document.cc?l=3824-3829&rcl=4debbed750aca54fe46c20a8c286c4b04fe483c3) that check, though it doesn't seem like anyone else does.",
